| logical_plan  | Sort: total_price DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: sum(o.o_totalprice) AS total_price, l.l_linestatus                                                                                                             |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[l.l_linestatus]], aggr=[[sum(o.o_totalprice)]]                                                                                                      |
|               |       Projection: o.o_totalprice, l.l_linestatus                                                                                                                             |
|               |         Inner Join: o.o_orderkey = l.l_orderkey                                                                                                                              |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: o                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             TableScan: orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_totalprice]                                                                                                          |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: l                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_linestatus]                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [total_price@0 DESC]                                                                                                                                |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[sum(o.o_totalprice)@1 as total_price, l_linestatus@0 as l_linestatus]                                                                                |
|               |     SortExec: expr=[sum(o.o_totalprice)@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[l_linestatus@0 as l_linestatus], aggr=[sum(o.o_totalprice)]                                                                 |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([l_linestatus@0], 16), input_partitions=16                                                                                        |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[l_linestatus@1 as l_linestatus], aggr=[sum(o.o_totalprice)]                                                                      |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[o_totalprice@1 as o_totalprice, l_linestatus@3 as l_linestatus]                                                                            |
|               |               SortMergeJoinExec: join_type=Inner, on=[(o_orderkey@0, l_orderkey@0)]                                                                                          |
|               |                 SortExec: expr=[o_orderkey@0 ASC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                              |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([o_orderkey@0], 16), input_partitions=16                                                                                |
|               |                     SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                       CayenneAccelerationExec: snapshots_scanned=<N>, files_scanned=<N>                                                                                      |
|               |                         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                           DataSourceExec: file_groups={16 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[o_orderkey, o_totalprice], file_type=vortex                                     |
|               |                 SortExec: expr=[l_orderkey@0 ASC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                              |
